```python
def compare_methods(spaced, cramming):
    score_spaced = evaluate_retention(spaced)
    score_cramming = evaluate_retention(cramming)

    if score_spaced > score_cramming:
        return 'spaced'
    elif score_cramming > score_spaced:
        return 'cramming'
    return 'tie'
```

